{"version":1,"content":"<p>今天有行業博主發帖爆料，汽車內容平台懂車帝接下來可能要針對內容做大調整。按照博主曬出的最新內部通知要求，平台接下來將全面收緊內容發佈的權限門檻，此前可以隨意做的多車橫向對比測試，後續直接被劃入了受限範疇，不再支持無資質的個人或者機構發佈這類內容。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/movie/1587626.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.219041+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T09:04:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:13.166516+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:13.166516+00:00","content_hash":"500d5fcfa2775879c808fb7f42ca3d55f133f01a1f57aef126c7fcb5ca5db05c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}